Description: A tidy interface to the rural properties declared in the
    Rural Environmental Registry of Brazil ('Cadastro Ambiental Rural',
    'CAR'), republished from the public service of the national system
    ('Sicar', <https://www.car.gov.br/>) as cloud-optimised 'GeoParquet'.
    Queries by state, municipality, status, size, bounding box, point or
    property code read only the parts of the remote files they need, so no
    full download of the registry is required, and precomputed summaries
    answer national counts in seconds. Results are returned as tibbles or
    'sf' objects. Small files are cached on disk per catalogue version and
    checked against their published 'SHA-256'. Network failures are handled
    gracefully.
